"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in 4.4beta1\nNot reproducible in 4.4dev7\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.beta1 - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3080 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.6094) - AMD Ryzen 5 3600 6-Core Processor (12 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nBug appeared in my project right after updating from 4.4dev7 to 4.4beta1. \n\nAn easy workaround is checking if the angle between the vectors are below some small value, and if they are then replace the quaternion with the quaternion identity.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nRotate an object with a quaternion created from the Quaternion(arc_from: Vector3, arc_to Vector3) constructor where the vectors are parallel or nearly parallel and in the same direction, and the resulting rotation will be a 180 degree arc.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[quaternion-issue.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18467897/quaternion-issue.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/r